# uv resolution lockfile — generated, never committed. `ibda` is published as a
# library, so it declares dependency ranges in pyproject.toml and leaves pinning to
# the consuming application; a committed lock here would pin nothing that matters and
# would go stale. Running any `uv` command in this checkout regenerates it.
uv.lock
